<title>TANZANIA: Tanzanian shilling falls on dlr, gains on pound.</title>
<headline>Tanzanian shilling falls on dlr, gains on pound.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling fell slightly against the dollar but gained on the pound sterling, the central Bank of Tanzania (BoT) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The shilling exchanged at a commercial mean rate of 625.6800 compared to Monday's 625.0464. Against pound sterling, the shilling exchanged at 1056.4638 compared to Monday's 1056.6118.</p>
<p>--255 51 112939</p>
